**Outcome: investigate further / escalate — execution blocked by budget gate.**

Findings:
- **PO-9001** (SUP-GRAIN-01, 500 requested) came back **PARTIALLY_CONFIRMED at 250 units** — a real 250-unit shortfall against the original request.
- Second supplier **SUP-GRAIN-02** (Premium Millers Co) can cover the gap: MOQ 50, case pack OK, lead time 4 days, allocation 400 available, reliability 0.91 — but at **₹610/unit vs. ₹420/unit** from the original supplier (+45% cost).
