2. Decide whether to (a) approve a budget exception/reallocate ~₹107,500 from another line to cover SUP-GRAIN-02 at 250 units, (b) reduce the order quantity to fit the ₹45,000 available budget (~73 units at ₹610, rounded to case pack of 10 → 70 units), or (c) wait for SUP-GRAIN-01's next allocation cycle instead of paying the premium.
3. If approved, I can re-run `validate_plan`/`create_purchase_order` with the approved quantity/supplier and close the loop with a post-execution validation (quantity 0) to confirm no other issues remain.

